# ── Rust / Cargo build output ──────────────────────────────────────────────
/target
/target-test
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb

# ── Editors / OS cruft ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── Logs & local scratch ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
/tmp/
/scratch/

# ── Internal working docs — kept out of the published repo ─────────────────
/docs/

# ── Reference material ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Local design/reference working set — the UI mockup, asset generators, and the
# full multi-platform brand pack. Only the few assets the build embeds are
# tracked; those are force-added past this rule.
/reference/

# ── Local tooling / agent config (not shared) ──────────────────────────────
/.claude/
/.conclaude.yaml
